[statement]
A character device whose magic is neither POSIX's nor GNU's, its device
fields zero and its owner names empty. Every reader reads device 0,0, and so
does ferrotape.

[archive]
header name=c typeflag=3 uname="" gname="" @257="xxxxxx"
header name=a
data "x"
end

[verdict]
all: read

